# Shell Solid (an extension): with nothing selected, New Group > Shell
# Solid says what to select; with the top face of the extrusion of
# path_extrude picked, the solid is hollowed to walls 1 mm thick, open
# there, and the group screen lists the face. Analyze > Check Solid
# finds it sound; the thickness takes an expression, and one that makes
# the walls meet is a problem on the group, the solid passing through.
key r
move 200 200
down L 200 200
up L 200 200
move 380 330
down L 380 330
up L 380 330
key esc
key x shift
answer ok
menu New Group|Shell Solid
move 290 265
down L 290 265
up L 290 265
menu New Group|Shell Solid
dump
tw
answer ok
menu Analyze|Check Solid
twmove 181 125
twdown L 181 125
twup L 181 125
edit 1+1
tw
answer ok
menu Analyze|Check Solid
twmove 253 125
twdown L 253 125
twup L 253 125
edit 30
tw
answer ok
menu Analyze|Check Solid
